# NODIQ-X dockerignore — keep secrets, credentials and local state out of
# the image build context. The Dockerfile COPYs only specific paths; these
# exclusions guarantee nothing sensitive can slip into a layer via context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
**/node_modules
apps/web/node_modules
server_data
**/server_data
*.log
logs
**/logs
.freebuff
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
tests
docs
*.md
!README.md
models
models/*
data/raw
data/raw/*
data/processed
data/processed/*
outputs
outputs/*
archive
archive/*
backups
backups/*
*.sqlite
*.db
apps/web/dist
!data/samples/summary_1000_fixed.csv
